WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
Some words are built on old Latin bases.

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:06.770
Port means carry, so a porter carries bags.

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:10.480
Tract means pull, so a tractor pulls a plow.

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:14.870
Struct means build, so a structure is something built.

00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:20.740
Find the base, ask what it does, and set a treasure back in its place.
